    "body": "Hi everyone.\r\n\r\nI have an idea for a can.route plugin. It would allow one to sepcify valid values for each can.route variable.\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n\r\n```js\r\ncan.route(':project/:category', { defaults: { ... }, valid: { project: ['canjs', 'jquerypp'], category: ['bug', 'article'] }}\r\ncan.route(':page/:category', { defaults: { ... }, valid: { page: ['greatest', 'latest'], category: [ ... ] }}\r\n\r\n/*\r\n\"/greatest/bugs\" => would match 2nd route\r\n\"/canjs/bugs\" => would match 1st route\r\n*/\r\n```\r\n\r\nThat way, it would be possible to match certain cases of currently non-determinable routes.\r\n\r\nThoughs?"
